    "question": "Mr. Gaurav is a partner in M/s. XYZ & Co., a CA firm with 6 partners. During assessment year 2020-21, Mr. Gaurav alone signed 290 tax audit reports under Section 44AB of the Income Tax Act (consisting of both corporate and non-corporate assessees) on behalf of the firm. The other 5 partners signed 14 tax audit reports each. Is Mr. Gaurav or the firm guilty of professional misconduct under Council General Guidelines, 2008?",
